			"hadithnumber": 3419,
			"arabicnumber": 3419,
			"text": "It was narrated that Ibn ‘Abbas said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) forbade tipping up water skins. After the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) had forbidden that, a man got up at night and tipped up a water skin, and a snake fell out of it onto him.”",
